type: software
title: >
  paracasei-SCA72564: Data and analysis files for the de novo genome
  assembly and functional characterization of Lacticaseibacillus
  paracasei subsp. paracasei SCA72564
authors:
  - family-names: Vallente
    given-names: Jan Ephraim R.
