      Center for Cellular and Molecular Medical Research, College of Medicine, 
      Mariano Marcos State University, Batac 2906, Ilocos Norte, Philippines
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-06-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ephraimrv/paracasei-SCA72564
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
abstract: >
  Raw data outputs and custom analysis scripts supporting the in silico
  functional genomic characterization of Lacticaseibacillus paracasei
  subsp. paracasei SCA72564, isolated from Dioscorea esculenta in Ilocos
  Norte, Philippines. Includes SPAdes assembly outputs, Bakta annotation
  files, eggNOG/KEGG/CAZy functional profiling tables, safety screening
  results, and the Matplotlib script generating Figure 2 of the companion
  manuscript.
keywords:
  - Lacticaseibacillus paracasei
